  "description": "The all new Quest models are the ‘SUV’ of eBikes; comfortable, capable and tough. They can handle the worst that the urban environment can throw at them as well as light off road duties when needed.\nThe Quest 2.0 steps up the specification to be a fantastic allrounder. Featuring a powerful mid drive motor its perfect for commuting, exploring, shopping, or just making jumping on a bike a breeze.\nThe super low step through frame design is made for accessibility. Fuss free with it’s integrated cables, headset, and 11.6ah battery giving a clean look and increased reliability. The mid mounted 250w Ananda M81 motor produces a consistent 80nm of torque ensuring the wind is always in your sails.\nWhen riding the Quest 2.0 comfort comes as standard. High volume 2.35” tyres, 100mm front suspension by SR Suntour, suspension seat post, Selle Royal comfort saddle, adjustable stem, ergonomic grips, and bar mounted digital display are all there to give you the best ride possible.\nTopping this all off is a set of full length mudguards, rear mounted rack, and built in lights. Could you want for any more? We don’t think so…..\nThe Quest 2.0 is available in 25km/h or 32km/hr speed models depending on location.\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
